flowchart TB
    N1["1. neo-vm-rs: Trust boundary shows what must be proven rather than believed."]
    N2["2. Trusted base: NeoVM 3.9.x semantics, opcode table, syscall contract"]
    N3["3. Untrusted input: NeoVM bytecode | initial stack | syscall host callbacks"]
    N4["4. Validation boundary: opcode, stack types, gas, jump target, and syscall response must be valid"]
    N5["5. Replay and ordering: VM context binds script and host state"]
    N6["6. Authority: authority comes from invocation context and syscall host, not bytecode alone"]
    N7["7. External systems: L2 execution engine, syscall host, bridge, state manager"]
    N8["8. Observed evidence: opcode progress, gas, stack digest, fault reason, and syscall boundary"]
    N1 --> N2
    N1 --> N3
    N1 --> N4
    N1 --> N5
    N1 --> N6
    N1 --> N7
    N1 --> N8
